    "bbox": [
      188.42,
      178.4,
      425.18,
      200.54
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR 17 NOVEMBER 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      196.37,
      205.58,
      419.78,
      218.06
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 17 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      221.09,
      554.45,
      264.5
    ],
    "text": "The Deep Depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal and adjoining Southwest Bay of Bengal has intensified into a Cyclonic Storm and has been named \u201cAkvan\u201d (pronounced: Akvan).",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      267.65,
      555.03,
      337.49
    ],
    "text": "The system was centred near latitude 12.2\u00b0N and longitude 85.7\u00b0E (approximately 640 km from Trincomalee) at around 11.30 p.m. on 16th November 2026. The system is very likely to continue moving north-northwestwards and intensify further into a Severe Cyclonic Storm over the Westcentral Bay of Bengal around 05.30 p.m. on 17th November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      340.76,
      554.79,
      410.57
    ],
    "text": "Thereafter, it is likely to move northwestwards and further intensify into a Very Severe Cyclonic Storm around 05.30 a.m. on 19th November 2026. Continuing its northwestward movement, the system is likely to cross the Andhra Pradesh and Yanam coasts between Nellore and Tuni around 11.30 a.m. on 20th November 2026 as a Very Severe Cyclonic Storm.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      414.23,
      555.02,
      452.69
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in the Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in the Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      455.99,
      555.05,
      493.39
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva province and in Ampara and Hambantota districts after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      496.69,
      380.78,
      517.27
    ],
    "text": "Mainly fair weather will prevail over the other areas of the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      526.03,
      520.49,
      541.75
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early hours of the morning.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      545.41,
      513.96,
      598.08
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
